mehlel,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"iei me pwuhng sohrkisangehr sampah wet.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"I ahpw nda; ‘Kumwail koht ekei,","poem":1},{"text":"kumwail koaros sapwellimen Wasa Lapalahpie.’","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Ahpw kumwail pahn mehla duwehte aramas akan;","poem":1},{"text":"amwail mour pahn pil sohrasang rasehng sapwellimen nanmwarki pwutak.”","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Maing Koht, komw ketido kaunda sampah;","poem":1},{"text":"wehi koaros nin sampah iei sapwellimomwi.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pon_sspon/PSA/82.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pon_sspon/PSA/83.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pon_sspon/PSA/81.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}